OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow      
OL,5,CToday:FA cold and frosty start, but a  
OL,6,Fdry day with plenty of sunshine. Any   
OL,7,Fshowers in the far north will ease,    
OL,8,Fthough it will become breezier across  
OL,9,Fwestern and southwestern areas later.  
OL,10,FTemperature below the November average.
OL,12,CTonight:FCold overnight with           
OL,13,Fwidespread frost. Cloudier in          
OL,14,Fnortheast England and eastern Scotland 
OL,15,Fwith a few showers, wintry over hills. 
OL,16,FWind and cloud increasing in the       
OL,17,Fsouthwest, with rain arriving later.   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
