OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow      
OL,5,CSunday:FMostly dry across central and  
OL,6,Fnorthern areas with sunny spells. Rain 
OL,7,Fspreads into the southwest with        
OL,8,Fstrengthening winds. Temperatures near 
OL,9,Fnormal, though rather cold for the     
OL,10,Fnorth and west.                        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
